        "representativeTime": 128.733,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-042.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-002"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-043",
        "start": 131.35,
        "end": 136.74,
        "text": "还有感受，就比如说你来到静安寺，你的画面已经体现出你你在静安寺了，这个时候你的口播文案",
        "representativeTime": 134.045,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-043.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-002"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-044",
        "start": 136.75,
        "end": 138.372,
        "text": "就不要手，我来到静安寺",
        "representativeTime": 137.561,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-044.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-002"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-045",
        "start": 138.372,
        "end": 143.83,
        "text": "老手说静安寺好大呀，画面已经体现的信息量，就不要再用你的口播和文案去增加了",
        "representativeTime": 141.101,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-045.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-002"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-046",
        "start": 143.84,
        "end": 147.973,
        "text": "我们做需求这一步呢，有几个方法，一个是身份认同，一个是描绘蓝图",
        "representativeTime": 145.906,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-046.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-002"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-047",
        "start": 147.973,
        "end": 152.64,
        "text": "第三个呢就是预判决策卡点和解决，第三步呢就是选择你的场景和氛围，有两种",
        "representativeTime": 150.306,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-047.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-002",
          "SHOT-003"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-048",
        "start": 152.65,
        "end": 157.9,
        "text": "一种是共情，一种是造梦，那么第四步呢就是选题，诶，一个就是懂用户，一个是可持续",
        "representativeTime": 155.275,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-048.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-003"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-049",
        "start": 157.91,
        "end": 162.98,
        "text": "第三点就是陪伴与成长，爆款细品没有特别大的意义，爆款系列才有特别大的意义",
        "representativeTime": 160.445,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-049.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-003"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-050",
        "start": 162.99,
        "end": 164.49,
        "text": "那么第五点呢就是迭代",
        "representativeTime": 163.74,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-050.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-003"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-051",
        "start": 164.49,
        "end": 168.99,
        "text": "平台在讨论我们发出一条视频之后，我们要怎么做复盘和总结去提升",
        "representativeTime": 166.74,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-051.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-003"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-052",
        "start": 169,
        "end": 171.239,
        "text": "利用好你的评论区去看用户会共鸣什么",
        "representativeTime": 170.12,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-052.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-003"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-053",
        "start": 171.239,
        "end": 174.927,
        "text": "和自查用户在评论区里面的交互是否和我这条视频有较大的关系",
        "representativeTime": 173.083,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-053.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-003"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-054",
        "start": 174.927,
        "end": 178.88,
        "text": "比如说你是一条旅游vlog，那用户在评论区里面讨论都是，唉呀",
        "representativeTime": 176.904,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-054.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-003"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-055",
        "start": 178.89,
        "end": 182.288,
        "text": "姐姐你好漂亮呀，那用户关注的点和你想表达的点就有偏差的",
        "representativeTime": 180.589,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-055.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-003"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-056",
        "start": 182.288,
        "end": 186.82,
        "text": "其次呢，你还可以在评论区去找到新的选题，通过用户的反馈来了解用户想看什么",
        "representativeTime": 184.554,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-056.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-003"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-057",
        "start": 186.83,
        "end": 191.496,
        "text": "那我们在数据复盘的时候，我们要注重c，T,R以及你的交互，就是你的赞转评，其次呢",
        "representativeTime": 189.163,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-057.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-003",
          "SHOT-004"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-058",
        "start": 191.496,
        "end": 193.362,
        "text": "你就是不要单点去解读你的数据反馈",
        "representativeTime": 192.429,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-058.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-004"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-059",
        "start": 193.362,
        "end": 195.93,
        "text": "只分析冷冰冰的数据，我们是做不出来带有温度的",
        "representativeTime": 194.646,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-059.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-004"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-060",
        "start": 195.94,
        "end": 199.877,
        "text": "好内容的，那么今天的课程就到这里，我是人类最想编的，我们下期再见",
        "representativeTime": 197.909,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-060.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-004",
          "SHOT-005"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
